download_url":"https://github.com/Kevin-Kaiyo/open-microled-driver-asic/releases/download/driver-robustness-20261024/driver-robustness-20261024-nrz-waveforms-001.tar.gz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kevin-Kaiyo/open-microled-driver-asic/releases/assets/671797480","id":671797480,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU51sWc4oCtDo","name":"driver-robustness-20261024-nrz-waveforms-002.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Kevin-Kaiyo","id":196529319,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7bMpw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196529319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo","html_url":"https://github.com/Kevin-Kaiyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Kaiyo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":461634307,"digest":"sha256:71c9407af86446cc0304c8669252ee09d7a16f42e8d0b9700f725075be35a256","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-24T09:11:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:11:58Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Kevin-Kaiyo/open-microled-driver-asic/releases/download/driver-robustness-20261024/driver-robustness-20261024-nrz-waveforms-002.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kevin-Kaiyo/open-microled-driver-asic/tarball/driver-robustness-20261024","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kevin-Kaiyo/open-microled-driver-asic/zipball/driver-robustness-20261024","body":"# 显示 PWM 与高速 NRZ：供电、电阻角、封装扰动验证\n\n研究快照源提交：`9d84753bae099e497a813f9097b1ce6eeb2f2df7`。本项目用于实验性研发方法验证和教学；本次发布完成实验与证据归档，不表示所有电路条件通过或具备流片资格。\n\n- 旧 NRZ 核心的 9–11 mV 电压余量不能覆盖 +50 mV 供电变化或本轮声明的供电/回地封装 R/L。新的实际厚栅氧核心完成 DRC、LVS、PEX 与电气复验，MicroLED 负载和接收条件保持不变。\n- 电流转向 B 在 0.5 Gb/s 的本轮所测扰动条件下通过。电压驱动 A 在固定辅助电源的三个条件下通过 0.4 Gb/s，但辅助电源扰动仍存在失败。最终矩阵为 16 个 DC 与 49 个瞬态案例；42 个瞬态通过、7 个 A 路功能失败；器件端压筛查无失败。未据此声称连续速率范围或实测 BER。\n- 显示 PWM 单独采用既有 100 µA 合成负载。板侧参考滤波使选定参考电源阶跃下的电流偏移从 47.852% 降到 3.061%，恢复时间为 17.713 µs，仍超过本轮 5 µs 研究预算。严格数值设置下的启动收敛未闭合；失败日志保留。\n\n入口：`docs/research/driver-robustness-20261024/index.html`；实际 GDS 分层查看器：同目录 `layout-viewer.html`。研究报告区分电路假设、实际版图验证、寄生仿真、未通过条件和未覆盖的工程风险。\n\n## 备份与恢复范围\n\n附件按 NRZ/PWM 的 inputs、metadata、waveforms，以及 physical-evidence、report-support 分组。逐文件与归档 SHA-256 清单覆盖本轮原始波形、成功与失败日志、候选版本和实际物理验证。完整 PDK、工具安装、Python 环境、VM 和其它历史 build 不在本轮增量归档内；符号链接单独记录，不伪装为完整文件备份。\n\n从此提交恢复源代码，使用 `scripts/backup/release_bundle.py` 校验并恢复指定分组。小输入复现入口及详细命令在 `docs/development-handoff.md`。原日志中的本机绝对路径作为历史证据保留；新运行应创建新目录并重新生成路径。\n\n状态：源提交已推送并核对远端；归档正在上传/远端回读验证。完成后更新本说明与主分支验证回执。上传成功本身不等于备份验证完成。\n"}